      "bytes": "# Project instructions (from the harness profile; the repo's own instruction files are not read)

A small shop: cart, discounts, checkout.

## Commands
- install: \`npm ci --ignore-scripts\`
- test: \`npx vitest run\`
- test_one: \`npx vitest run {file}\`
- lint: \`npx eslint {files}\`
- typecheck: \`npx tsc --noEmit\`

## Boundaries
- Do not change tests for a bugfix.
- Prices are integer cents.

## Style
- 2 spaces
- double quotes

## Conventions
- commit title: <type>: <what>

## Definition of done
- bugfix: a test that failed before passes
